From e173d1561c3ae60b3848901bfcbb3fc812fb0299 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: k8s-snap strict <k8s-snap-strict@canonical.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:03:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strict: flavor patch

- confinement: strict, assumes snapd2.62
- OPENSSL_MODULES repointed to base path, EDITOR=nano for kubectl edit
- top-level plugs incl. docker-support, kubernetes-support flavors,
  system-files for /etc/kubernetes,/etc/cni/net.d,/etc/sysctl.d/1000-cilium.conf,
  /var/log/kubernetes; kernel-module-load for cilium
- layouts for base-owned paths (/var/lib/*, /opt/cni/bin, /usr/libexec,
  /usr/local/lib, /var/log/pods|containers, /etc/nanorc)
- per-app plug sets; k8sd install-mode: disable (health gate enables it)
- hooks stanza with plugs
- connect-plug-* symlinks to configure for every declared plug
- remove k8s/pebble (host systemd supervision flavor, classic-only)
